# Determinism is a product invariant (ALGORITHM.md §12) and CI compares golden
# output across Linux, macOS and Windows. Text checked out with CRLF on Windows
# would change extracted source spans and therefore rendered bytes, so line
# endings are normalized in the repository rather than left to each machine's
# core.autocrlf setting.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Fixtures are inputs to golden tests: their bytes are part of the expectation,
# so they must never be rewritten by any checkout-time conversion.
fixtures/** -text
*.scm text eol=lf

# Binary artifacts that must not be normalized.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
